{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W6HckcdCzKASGTuKQ4PetU","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Compounding 发现被承认为有价值的实证贡献，但 RateQuant Appendix M 已 acknowledge\n2\t  该现象导致 novelty 打折。 Reviewer 要求去掉 ''universal'' 改为 ''consistent pattern across 8 architectures''，constraint\n3\t  被部分 reviewer  视为 ''obvious hyperparameter tuning'' 而非 principled contribution，需要更强的理论\n4\t  justification。 1/8 downstream benefit 被至少 1 位 reviewer 视为 ''this only works on Qwen''。Diagnostic\n5\t  n=9 只能作为  observation，不能作为独立 claim。论文需要 reframe 为 empirical analysis paper，前置 analysis\n6\t  contribution。 预估 narrative rewrite 30-40%，主要集中在 intro、claim 措辞、和 related work 对\n7\t  RateQuant 的讨论。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: L0 Exclusion Removal Ablation\n12\t  plan_id: plan_001\n13\t  description: '移除 L0 排除约束，仅保留 max_2bit=8，验证 solver 纯粹从 profiling data 自动发现 L0 敏感结构。\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    solver_auto_assigns_8bit_to_L0: true\n18\t    ppl_without_l0_exclusion: 10.91\n19\t    ppl_with_l0_exclusion: 10.91\n20\t    delta: 0.0\n21\t    l0_heads_assigned_8bit: 4\n22\t    bit_distribution: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n23\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下该结果被 reviewer 认可为 neat ablation——solver 自动发现 L0 是最敏感的层，\n24\t    不需要手动排除。但 reviewer 会指出这只在 Qwen 上验证（L0 dominance ratio=26×）， 对于 L0 dominance 低的架构（Yi\n25\t    0.07，Mistral 1.74）solver 是否同样能自动发现正确结构 缺少验证。一位 reviewer 可能注释 \"this is expected\n26\t    — L0 has the largest profiling delta  by far, so any reasonable solver would protect\n27\t    it.\" 不会成为主要 objection，但也不会 被视为独立贡献。\n28\t\n29\t    '\n30\t  tables:\n31\t  - caption: 'Table: L0 Exclusion Ablation (Qwen2.5-7B, budget=0.25)'\n32\t    rows:\n33\t    - condition: MCKP + L0 exclusion + max_2bit=8\n34\t      ppl: 10.91\n35\t      l0_bit: 8-bit (hard-coded)\n36\t      note: 原始设置\n37\t    - condition: MCKP + max_2bit=8 only\n38\t      ppl: 10.91\n39\t      l0_bit: 8-bit (solver-discovered)\n40\t      note: solver 自动分配\n41\t  figures_description:\n42\t  - Bit allocation heatmap 对比：有/无 L0 exclusion，两者完全一致\n43\t  analysis: 'Reviewer 评价：supportive but minor。在 median 档中被视为 completeness ablation  而非核心证据。reviewer\n44\t    可能建议移到 appendix。不影响主要 claim 但增加 paper 完整性。\n45\t\n46\t    '\n47\t- name: Llama-3.1-8B Full Pipeline Replication\n48\t  plan_id: plan_002\n49\t  description: '在 Llama-3.1-8B（GQA 4:1）上复制完整 pipeline——profiling、constrained MCKP、PPL\n50\t    评估。 测试跨架构泛化性。\n51\t\n52\t    '\n53\t  expected_results:\n54\t    baseline_ppl_bf16: 8.09\n55\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 8.47\n56\t    mckp_constrained_ppl: 8.45\n57\t    delta_vs_uniform_pct: 0.2\n58\t    delta_vs_uniform_ppl: 0.02\n59\t    memory_ratio: 0.25\n60\t    bit_distribution: '{2:2, 4:253, 8:1}'\n61\t    natural_2bit_count: 2\n62\t    constraint_binds: false\n63\t    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.07\n64\t    top5_concentration: 0.57\n65\t    distribution_shape: Spike\n66\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下，Llama 的 marginal 结果（+0.2% vs uniform）成为 reviewer 攻击点之一。\n67\t    reviewer 会写 \"the method provides essentially no benefit on Llama — the +0.2%  improvement\n68\t    is within noise.\" Llama 的 spike distribution（L2H5 单个 outlier 主导， t₁/t₅≈0.85）导致\n69\t    solver 只选择 2 个 head 做 2-bit，constraint 从不触发（natural k=2 < max_2bit=8）， MCKP 优化空间极小。这解释了为什么\n70\t    PPL 差异几乎为零。但从 compounding 角度， unconstrained 仍然 1.07× baseline，说明即使 mild 情况下 solver\n71\t    仍会略微 over-allocate。 Reviewer 会要求诚实报告 \"no benefit\" 而非 spin 为 positive。在 median\n72\t    档中， 这个 negative result 本身不被反对——reviewer 反对的是用 8 个架构中只有 1 个 positive  来声称 method\n73\t    有效。\n74\t\n75\t    '\n76\t  tables:\n77\t  - caption: 'Table: Llama-3.1-8B Pipeline Results (budget=0.25)'\n78\t    rows:\n79\t    - method: BF16 baseline\n80\t      ppl: 8.09\n81\t      bits: '16'\n82\t      note: ''\n83\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n84\t      ppl: 8.47\n85\t      bits: '4.0'\n86\t      note: ''\n87\t    - method: Unconstrained MCKP\n88\t      ppl: 8.63\n89\t      bits: mixed\n90\t      note: 1.07× baseline\n91\t    - method: Constrained MCKP (k=8)\n92\t      ppl: 8.45\n93\t      bits: '{2:2, 4:253, 8:1}'\n94\t      note: +0.2% vs uniform\n95\t  figures_description:\n96\t  - Per-head sensitivity heatmap：极少数 head 有显著 delta，大部分 flat\n97\t  analysis: 'Median reviewer 会同时肯定和批评：肯定 honest reporting of negative result， 批评 \"if\n98\t    7/8 architectures show no benefit, this is not a method paper — it''s an  analysis\n99\t    paper that happens to find one architecture where optimization helps.\"  这强化了 reframe\n100\t    为 empirical analysis 的需要。\n101\t\n102\t    '\n103\t- name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 Full Pipeline Replication\n104\t  plan_id: plan_003\n105\t  description: '在 Mistral-7B-v0.3 上复制完整 pipeline。不同架构家族，建立跨架构有效性。\n106\t\n107\t    '\n108\t  expected_results:\n109\t    baseline_ppl_bf16: 7.035\n110\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 7.131\n111\t    mckp_constrained_ppl: 7.165\n112\t    delta_vs_uniform_pct: -0.5\n113\t    delta_vs_uniform_ppl: -0.034\n114\t    memory_ratio: 0.25\n115\t    bit_distribution: '{2:4, 4:252}'\n116\t    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.08\n117\t    top5_concentration: 0.22\n118\t    distribution_shape: Flat\n119\t    k_ablation_monotonic: true\n120\t    best_k_still_worse_than_uniform: true\n121\t  result_rationale: 'Mistral 是最强 negative case：MCKP 在所有 k 值下都 worse than uniform。\n122\t    PPL 随 k 单调递增（k=4: 7.165, k=8: 7.200, k=18: 7.323），profiler 报告近零  sensitivity 差异（concentration=0.22,\n123\t    CV=1.31）。这表明 Mistral 的 KV head  sensitivity 高度均匀——没有 head 从 2-bit downgrade 中获益。Median\n124\t    reviewer  会将此视为 \"method failure on flat architectures\" 和 \"proof that uniform 4-bit  is\n125\t    optimal when profiler gives zero signal.\" 对 compounding claim 仍有帮助： unconstrained\n126\t    1.08× 表明即使 flat distribution，solver 仍 over-allocate  2-bit heads（42/256=16.4%）。但\n127\t    reviewer 会质疑 \"1.08× is hardly catastrophic  — this is within the range where a\n128\t    practitioner wouldn''t even notice.\"\n129\t\n130\t    '\n131\t  tables:\n132\t  - caption: 'Table: Mistral-7B-v0.3 k-Ablation (budget=0.25)'\n133\t    rows:\n134\t    - k: 4\n135\t      ppl: 7.165\n136\t      n_2bit: 4\n137\t      note: best constrained, still > uniform\n138\t    - k: 8\n139\t      ppl: 7.2\n140\t      n_2bit: 8\n141\t      note: ''\n142\t    - k: 16\n143\t      ppl: 7.311\n144\t      n_2bit: 16\n145\t      note: ''\n146\t    - k: uniform\n147\t      ppl: 7.131\n148\t      n_2bit: 0\n149\t      note: optimal for Mistral\n150\t  figures_description:\n151\t  - k-PPL 单调递增曲线，与 Qwen 的 U-shaped 对比\n152\t  analysis: '在 median 档中，Mistral negative result 既是弱点也是优势。弱点：method 不 work。 优势：honest\n153\t    negative result 增加 credibility，且支持 diagnostic 的必要性—— 如果没有 diagnostic，practitioners\n154\t    会浪费 profiling 时间在 Mistral 这样的模型上。 Reviewer 2 (偏方法) 会将此作为 \"method only works on\n155\t    Qwen\" 的证据。 Reviewer 3 (偏分析) 会认可这增加了 paper 的科学价值。\n156\t\n157\t    '\n158\t- name: Compounding Effect Characterization Sweep\n159\t  plan_id: plan_004\n160\t  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B 上扫 max_2bit 从 0 到 112，绘制 PPL vs max_2bit 曲线， 确定 compounding\n161\t    阈值。建立 cardinality constraint 的 principled 基础。\n162\t\n163\t    '\n164\t  expected_results:\n165\t    k0_ppl: 9.81\n166\t    k8_ppl: 10.05\n167\t    k16_ppl: 10.42\n168\t    k32_ppl: 11.6\n169\t    k64_ppl: 23.22\n170\t    k112_ppl: 98.75\n171\t    compounding_threshold_k: 16\n172\t    max_compounding_ratio: 10.07\n173\t    curve_shape: superlinear after k≈16, exponential after k≈48\n174\t    safe_k_range: k≤8 universally <2.5% degradation\n175\t  result_rationale: 'Compounding sweep 是 median 档中最被认可的实验——提供了 compounding 效应的 定量证据。PPL\n176\t    在 k≤8 时近线性增长（9.81→10.05, +2.4%），k=16-32 开始加速 （10.42→11.60），k≥48 后指数爆炸（23.22→98.75）。这条曲线是\n177\t    \"principled  basis for constraint selection\" 的核心证据。但 median reviewer 会有两个质疑： (1)\n178\t    \"这条曲线只在 Qwen 上做了——其他架构的阈值可能完全不同\"（A2）， (2) \"RateQuant Appendix M 已经 acknowledge\n179\t    compounding，这个 sweep 只是 quantified 了已知现象\"（A1）。需要补充 Llama 和 Mistral 的 compounding\n180\t    sweep  来部分 address (1)——实际已有数据（llama_compounding_sweep, mistral_compounding_sweep_v2）\n181\t    可以回应。Reviewer 对 k≤8 safety 的 claim 会接受，但会要求去掉 \"universally safe\"  改为 \"safe across\n182\t    all tested architectures.\"\n183\t\n184\t    '\n185\t  tables:\n186\t  - caption: 'Table: Compounding Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B, budget=0.25)'\n187\t    rows:\n188\t    - k: 0\n189\t      ppl: 9.81\n190\t      ratio_to_baseline: 1.00×\n191\t    - k: 8\n192\t      ppl: 10.05\n193\t      ratio_to_baseline: 1.02×\n194\t    - k: 16\n195\t      ppl: 10.42\n196\t      ratio_to_baseline: 1.06×\n197\t    - k: 32\n198\t      ppl: 11.6\n199\t      ratio_to_baseline: 1.18×\n200\t    - k: 64\n201\t      ppl: 23.22\n202\t      ratio_to_baseline: 2.37×\n203\t    - k: 112\n204\t      ppl: 98.75\n205\t      ratio_to_baseline: 10.07×\n206\t  figures_description:\n207\t  - PPL vs max_2bit 曲线（log-scale y-axis），标注 safe zone（k≤8）和 catastrophic zone（k≥48）\n208\t  - 三架构对比 compounding sweep（Qwen U-shaped, Llama flat, Mistral monotonic）\n209\t  analysis: 'Median reviewer 的核心反馈：compounding effect 是 real and well-characterized，\n210\t    但 novelty 因 RateQuant Appendix M 打折。建议在 related work 中显式讨论  \"RateQuant acknowledges\n211\t    compounding in Appendix M but does not characterize the  threshold or provide\n212\t    a fix — our sweep provides the first quantitative mapping.\"  三架构对比增加说服力：Qwen 的\n213\t    U-shape（optimal k=8）、Llama 的 flat profile （natural k=2, constraint irrelevant）、Mistral\n214\t    的 monotonic increase（every  2-bit head hurts）展示了 architecture-dependent compounding\n215\t    behavior。\n216\t\n217\t    '\n218\t- name: Budget Sweep (2×/4×/8× Compression)\n219\t  plan_id: plan_005\n220\t  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 2×/4×/8× 压缩比下的 constrained MCKP vs uniform baseline。\n221\t\n222\t    '\n223\t  expected_results:\n224\t    budget_0.5_mckp_ppl: 9.85\n225\t    budget_0.5_uniform_ppl: 9.86\n226\t    budget_0.5_delta_pct: 0.1\n227\t    budget_0.25_mckp_ppl: 10.91\n228\t    budget_0.25_uniform_ppl: 15.45\n229\t    budget_0.25_delta_pct: 29.4\n230\t    budget_0.125_mckp_ppl: 57.6\n231\t    budget_0.125_uniform_2bit_ppl: 2643.77\n232\t    budget_0.125_delta_ratio: 45.9×\n233\t    compression_amplifies_benefit: true\n234\t  result_rationale: 'Budget sweep 展示了核心趋势：压缩越激进，constrained MCKP vs uniform 的差距越大。\n235\t    在 2× 压缩下差异几乎为零（都接近 baseline），4× 时 MCKP 优势 29.4%，8× 时 MCKP 57.60 vs uniform 2643.77（45×差距）。Median\n236\t    reviewer 会认可 aggressive  compression 的 practical value（\"at 8× compression, the\n237\t    constraint is the difference  between usable and unusable\"），但会指出：(a) 2× 结果说明 moderate\n238\t    compression 下 benefit 主要来自 Qwen 的 spread pattern 而非 method 本身，(b) 8× 的 PPL=57.60  虽远好于\n239\t    2643.77，但 absolute 值仍然很高——\"is a 57.60 PPL model actually usable?\"  需要补充 aggressive\n240\t    compression 下的 downstream task 评估。(c) 只在 Qwen 上做了 full sweep，Llama 的 aggressive\n241\t    compression 数据（57.60 vs 2643.77）虽有但 仅一个点，不是 sweep。\n242\t\n243\t    '\n244\t  tables:\n245\t  - caption: 'Table: Budget Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B)'\n246\t    rows:\n247\t    - compression: 2× (budget=0.5)\n248\t      mckp_ppl: 9.85\n249\t      uniform_ppl: 9.86\n250\t      delta: ~0%\n251\t    - compression: 4× (budget=0.25)\n252\t      mckp_ppl: 10.91\n253\t      uniform_ppl: 15.45\n254\t      delta: 29.4%\n255\t    - compression: 8× (budget=0.125)\n256\t      mckp_ppl: 57.6\n257\t      uniform_ppl: 2643.77\n258\t      delta: 45.9×\n259\t  figures_description:\n260\t  - Compression ratio vs PPL 对比图：MCKP 和 uniform 两条线在高压缩比处剧烈分离\n261\t  analysis: 'Median 档中被部分接受。Reviewer 认可 practical implication（高压缩比下 constraint  essential），但质疑\n262\t    moderate compression（主要应用场景）下只有 Qwen 获益的泛化性。 建议补充 Llama/Mistral 的 budget sweep\n263\t    至少在 8× 压缩点。\n264\t\n265\t    '\n266\t- name: High-Resolution Profiling\n267\t  plan_id: plan_006\n268\t  description: '64 seq × 2048 tokens 的高分辨率 profiling（vs 16×512），验证更好的 profiling  是否改善\n269\t    solver allocation。\n270\t\n271\t    '\n272\t  expected_results:\n273\t    hires_constrained_ppl_bf16: 10.91\n274\t    lowres_constrained_ppl_bf16: 11.23\n275\t    baseline_ppl_bf16: 9.81\n276\t    improvement_vs_lowres: 0.32\n277\t    improvement_pct: 2.8\n278\t    hires_nonzero_2bit_heads: 100\n279\t    lowres_nonzero_2bit_heads: 37\n280\t    allocation_diff_count: 8\n281\t    profiling_time_min: 65.5\n282\t    bit_distribution: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n283\t  result_rationale: '高分辨率 profiling 将 PPL 从 11.23 降到 10.91（-2.8%），说明 profiling resolution  matters。核心改进来自更准确的\n284\t    sensitivity ranking：hires 发现 100/112 heads 有 非零 2-bit delta（vs lowres 37/112），导致\n285\t    8 个 head 的 allocation 改变。 Median reviewer 反应分化：(a) 方法 reviewer 认为这说明 \"profiling\n286\t    quality drives  results more than solver choice — the real engineering is in the\n287\t    profiler, not MCKP\"， 进一步削弱 solver 作为贡献的地位；(b) 系统 reviewer 注意到 65.5 min profiling\n288\t    time  并质疑 \"practitioners won''t spend an hour profiling a 7B model to save 0.32\n289\t    PPL\"。 需要在 paper 中 trade-off profiling cost vs quality，并论证 lowres 已足够好 （11.23 vs\n290\t    uniform 15.45, 仍有 27.3% improvement）。\n291\t\n292\t    '\n293\t  tables:\n294\t  - caption: 'Table: Profiling Resolution Impact (Qwen2.5-7B, k=8)'\n295\t    rows:\n296\t    - resolution: Low-res (16×512)\n297\t      ppl: 11.23\n298\t      nonzero_heads: 37\n299\t      time_min: ~10\n300\t    - resolution: High-res (64×2048)\n301\t      ppl: 10.91\n302\t      nonzero_heads: 100\n303\t      time_min: 65.5\n304\t    - resolution: Uniform 4-bit\n305\t      ppl: 15.45\n306\t      nonzero_heads: N/A\n307\t      time_min: 0\n308\t  figures_description:\n309\t  - Per-head delta comparison：lowres vs hires scatter plot，标注 allocation 改变的 8 个 head\n310\t  analysis: 'Median 档中作为 engineering insight 被接受。Reviewer 不会 object 但建议 放 appendix\n311\t    而非 main body。对 claim 的影响中性——既不强化也不削弱核心论点。\n312\t\n313\t    '\n314\t- name: C4 Cross-Dataset Evaluation\n315\t  plan_id: plan_007\n316\t  description: '在 C4 上评估 Qwen2.5-7B（calibrate on WikiText-2, eval on C4; calibrate\n317\t    on C4, eval on WikiText-2）， 验证结果不是 WikiText-2 specific。\n318\t\n319\t    '\n320\t  expected_results:\n321\t    c4_cal_wt2_eval_mckp_ppl: 11.29\n322\t    c4_cal_wt2_eval_uniform_ppl: 15.45\n323\t    c4_cal_wt2_eval_delta: 4.15\n324\t    allocation_agreement_c4_vs_wt2: 0.964\n325\t    agreement_heads: 108/112\n326\t    cross_domain_wt2_to_c4_mckp_ppl: 20.56\n327\t    cross_domain_wt2_to_c4_uniform_ppl: 35.42\n328\t    contamination_impact: 0.034\n329\t  result_rationale: '96.4% allocation agreement 跨 calibration source 是 positive signal：profiling  的\n330\t    head sensitivity ranking 对 calibration data 不敏感。Median reviewer 会认可  cross-dataset\n331\t    robustness 但指出：(a) 只在 Qwen 上验证（\"is this agreement rate  architecture-dependent?\"），(b)\n332\t    4/112 disagreement heads 的 identity 和影响未讨论， (c) cross-domain PPL（WiKi→C4: 20.56\n333\t    vs uniform 35.42）虽然 MCKP 仍胜出， 但绝对 PPL 远高于 same-domain（11.29），说明 calibration domain\n334\t    mismatch 仍有成本。 Reviewer 会建议 \"report agreement rate on at least one more architecture\"\n335\t    作为 minor revision。已有 llama_c4_cross_dataset（97.7% agreement）和  mistral_c4_cross_dataset（96.5%）数据可以回应。\n336\t\n337\t    '\n338\t  tables:\n339\t  - caption: 'Table: Cross-Dataset Calibration Agreement'\n340\t    rows:\n341\t    - model: Qwen2.5-7B\n342\t      agreement: 108/112 (96.4%)\n343\t      same_domain_ppl: 11.29\n344\t      cross_domain_ppl: 20.56\n345\t    - model: Llama-3.1-8B\n346\t      agreement: 250/256 (97.7%)\n347\t      same_domain_ppl: 8.45\n348\t      cross_domain_ppl: 8.65\n349\t    - model: Mistral-7B-v0.3\n350\t      agreement: 247/256 (96.5%)\n351\t      same_domain_ppl: 7.16\n352\t      cross_domain_ppl: 7.19\n353\t  figures_description: []\n354\t  analysis: '三架构的 >96% agreement 是 strong evidence for calibration robustness。 Median\n355\t    reviewer 视为 useful supplementary experiment，不会 object。 建议放 Section 4 或 appendix。\n356\t\n357\t    '\n358\t- name: RateQuant Greedy Comparison\n359\t  plan_id: plan_008\n360\t  description: '实现 RateQuant 的 greedy Algorithm 1 在 {2,4,8,16} 上，展示 greedy 在 non-consecutive\n361\t    集合上 suboptimal。\n362\t\n363\t    '\n364\t  expected_results:\n365\t    ratequant_greedy_unconstrained_ppl: 32.45\n366\t    mckp_unconstrained_ppl: 36.92\n367\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n368\t    greedy_bit_distribution: '{2:68, 4:30, 8:4, 16:10}'\n369\t    both_worse_than_uniform: true\n370\t    greedy_better_than_mckp_unconstrained: true\n371\t  result_rationale: '关键发现：两个 solver 在 unconstrained 设置下都 worse than uniform，但 greedy  (32.45)\n372\t    反而比 MCKP (36.92) 好！这颠覆了 \"MCKP is better optimizer\" 的叙事。 Median reviewer 会抓住这个点：\"if\n373\t    greedy outperforms MCKP unconstrained,  why do you need MCKP at all?\" 回应：unconstrained\n374\t    时两者都失败（compounding）， 差异无意义；constrained 时两者完全一致（Δ=0.0000）——plan_016 的 solver equivalence  证据。但这确实削弱了\n375\t    MCKP 作为 solver contribution 的叙事，支持 reframe： \"constraint is the contribution, not\n376\t    the solver.\" 一位 reviewer 会标注  \"the unconstrained MCKP being worse than greedy\n377\t    suggests the ILP formulation  interacts poorly with compounding — discuss this.\"\n378\t    需要在 paper 中解释为什么 MCKP 更容易 over-allocate 2-bit（因为它更 aggressively optimizes per-head  cost-benefit，导致更多\n379\t    2-bit assignments）。\n380\t\n381\t    '\n382\t  tables:\n383\t  - caption: 'Table: Unconstrained Solver Comparison (Qwen2.5-7B)'\n384\t    rows:\n385\t    - solver: RateQuant Greedy (unconstrained)\n386\t      ppl: 32.45\n387\t      n_2bit: 68\n388\t      status: FAIL\n389\t    - solver: MCKP (unconstrained)\n390\t      ppl: 36.92\n391\t      n_2bit: ≥68\n392\t      status: FAIL\n393\t    - solver: Uniform 4-bit\n394\t      ppl: 15.45\n395\t      n_2bit: 0\n396\t      status: baseline\n397\t  figures_description:\n398\t  - 'Bar chart: 三种 method PPL 对比，unconstrained 均远超 uniform'\n399\t  analysis: 'Median 档中该实验的价值被 reinterpret：不再是 \"MCKP beats greedy\"  而是 \"both fail without\n400\t    constraint, both succeed with constraint.\"  这是 solver equivalence 叙事的第一半证据。Reviewer\n401\t    认可这个 framing shift。\n402\t\n403\t    '\n404\t- name: Oracle Comparison (Subset Brute-Force)\n405\t  plan_id: plan_009\n406\t  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B 的 3-4 个 layer group 上做 brute-force optimal allocation，\n407\t    量化 MCKP gap to oracle。\n408\t\n409\t    '\n410\t  expected_results:\n411\t    mckp_ppl: 10.91\n412\t    max_oracle_gap_ppl: 0.018\n413\t    avg_oracle_gap_ppl: 0.005\n414\t    layers_mckp_optimal: 5/8\n415\t    layers_with_gap: 3\n416\t    gap_nature: 2-bit head position swap within same bit budget\n417\t    total_evals: 54\n418\t  result_rationale: 'MCKP 与 oracle 的 gap 极小（max 0.018 PPL, avg 0.005 PPL），5/8 layer\n419\t    groups  完全 optimal，3 个 gap 来自同 budget 下 2-bit head 位置互换。Median reviewer  会认可 \"MCKP\n420\t    is near-optimal within the constrained feasible set\" 但立刻指出： \"combined with plan_016\n421\t    showing greedy=MCKP, this means the constraint defines  the quality — any solver\n422\t    that respects the constraint is near-optimal. The MCKP  formulation adds no value.\"\n423\t    这进一步支持 constraint-as-contribution framing， 但同时使 MCKP 作为 method 贡献更不站得住。reviewer\n424\t    建议 \"present MCKP as the  analysis framework, not the algorithmic contribution.\"\n425\t    在 median 档中这个实验 反而帮助了 reframe——它是 \"solver doesn''t matter\" 叙事的 complementary evidence。\n426\t\n427\t    '\n428\t  tables:\n429\t  - caption: 'Table: MCKP vs Oracle Gap (Qwen2.5-7B, per layer group)'\n430\t    rows:\n431\t    - layer_group: L0-L3\n432\t      mckp_optimal: true\n433\t      gap_ppl: 0.0\n434\t    - layer_group: L4-L7\n435\t      mckp_optimal: false\n436\t      gap_ppl: 0.0045\n437\t    - layer_group: L8-L11\n438\t      mckp_optimal: false\n439\t      gap_ppl: 0.0136\n440\t    - layer_group: L12-L15\n441\t      mckp_optimal: true\n442\t      gap_ppl: 0.0\n443\t  figures_description: []\n444\t  analysis: 'Near-zero oracle gap 与 solver equivalence 共同构成 \"constraint is what matters\"  的完整论证。Median\n445\t    reviewer 视为 thorough analysis, 建议作为 Section 4 的 supporting evidence。\n446\t\n447\t    '\n448\t- name: Cross-Domain Calibration Robustness\n449\t  plan_id: plan_010\n450\t  description: 'C4 calibration → WikiText-2 eval 和反方向，报告 per-head allocation agreement\n451\t    rate。\n452\t\n453\t    '\n454\t  expected_results:\n455\t    allocation_agreement_c4_vs_wt2: 0.964\n456\t    agreement_heads: 108/112\n457\t    c4_cal_wt2_eval_mckp_ppl: 11.29\n458\t    cross_domain_gap_vs_same_domain: 0.06\n459\t  result_rationale: '与 plan_007 共享数据。96.4% agreement 说明 profiling-based sensitivity\n460\t    ranking  对 calibration source 高度鲁棒。Median reviewer 反应温和 positive——这是 expected\n461\t    behavior（\"if head sensitivity is an architectural property, it shouldn''t  depend\n462\t    on calibration data\"），所以不会 strongly impress but also won''t object。 主要 reviewer\n463\t    concern 是 Qwen-only，但已有三架构数据（Qwen 96.4%, Llama 97.7%,  Mistral 96.5%）可补充。\n464\t\n465\t    '\n466\t  tables: []\n467\t  figures_description: []\n468\t  analysis: 'Minor positive signal。在 median 档中作为 robustness check 被接受， 不影响 overall\n469\t    score。\n470\t\n471\t    '\n472\t- name: Head Sensitivity Visualization\n473\t  plan_id: plan_011\n474\t  description: '生成 per-head profiling delta heatmap、compounding curve、budget allocation\n475\t    对比图。\n476\t\n477\t    '\n478\t  expected_results:\n479\t    figures_generated: 3\n480\t    heatmap_shows_l0_dominance: true\n481\t    compounding_curve_elbow: k≈16\n482\t    allocation_comparison_shows_constraint_effect: true\n483\t  result_rationale: '可视化是 presentation quality 问题而非科学证据。Median reviewer 会在 minor comments\n484\t    中评价：\"Figure X clearly shows the L0 dominance pattern\"  或 \"the compounding curve\n485\t    would benefit from error bars.\" 不影响 score 但 好的可视化可以帮助 reviewer 快速理解 compounding\n486\t    现象。关键是 heatmap 要 展示 Qwen（spread, L0 cluster 明显）vs Yi（spike, 单个 L4H3 突出）vs  Gemma-2（flat,\n487\t    无显著差异）的对比——如果只展示 Qwen，reviewer 会说  \"cherry-picked visualization.\"\n488\t\n489\t    '\n490\t  tables: []\n491\t  figures_description:\n492\t  - Per-head 2-bit delta heatmap（layers × heads），色彩标注 Qwen L0 cluster\n493\t  - Compounding sweep 曲线（PPL vs k），标注 safe/moderate/catastrophic zones\n494\t  - 'Budget allocation 对比（stacked bar: 2/4/8/16 bit distribution across methods）'\n495\t  analysis: 'Presentation-level contribution。Median reviewer 可能 suggest 改进但不会 因为 visualization\n496\t    加分或扣分。\n497\t\n498\t    '\n499\t- name: K/V Separation\n500\t  plan_id: plan_014\n501\t  description: 'K 和 V heads 作为独立 MCKP items，独立 budget allocation。与 joint K=V 方法对比。\n502\t\n503\t    '\n504\t  expected_results:\n505\t    kv_sep_ppl: 11.22\n506\t    joint_kv_ppl: 10.91\n507\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n508\t    delta_sep_vs_joint: 0.31\n509\t    sep_k_2bit_count: 16\n510\t    sep_v_uniform_4bit: true\n511\t    kv_asymmetric_heads: 21\n512\t  result_rationale: 'K/V separation 反而 worse（11.22 vs 10.91, +0.31 PPL）。separation\n513\t    给 K heads  分配了 16 个 2-bit（超过 max_2bit=8 的 joint 约束），导致 K cache compounding。 V\n514\t    heads 在 separation 下全部 4-bit（optimal for V），但 K cache 的退化超过了 V 的收益。Median reviewer\n515\t    会认为这是 negative result 但有 insight value： \"K cache is more sensitive to 2-bit compounding\n516\t    than V — this explains why  joint K=V treatment with a single cardinality constraint\n517\t    works better.\"  一位 reviewer 可能 suggest \"apply per-cache-type cardinality constraint\"  as\n518\t    future work。不会成为 major objection。\n519\t\n520\t    '\n521\t  tables:\n522\t  - caption: 'Table: K/V Separation vs Joint (Qwen2.5-7B, k=8)'\n523\t    rows:\n524\t    - method: Joint K=V (k=8)\n525\t      ppl: 10.91\n526\t      k_2bit: 8\n527\t      v_2bit: 0\n528\t    - method: K/V Separation\n529\t      ppl: 11.22\n530\t      k_2bit: 16\n531\t      v_2bit: 0\n532\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n533\t      ppl: 15.45\n534\t      k_2bit: 0\n535\t      v_2bit: 0\n536\t  figures_description: []\n537\t  analysis: 'Negative result 但 informative。在 median 档中被视为 thorough ablation， 可放 appendix。不影响核心\n538\t    claim。\n539\t\n540\t    '\n541\t- name: Downstream Task Evaluation (Qwen2.5-7B)\n542\t  plan_id: plan_012\n543\t  description: 'ARC-C / HellaSwag / PIQA / WinoGrande 在 Qwen2.5-7B 4× 压缩下评估。 验证 PPL\n544\t    improvement 转化为 downstream performance。\n545\t\n546\t    '\n547\t  expected_results:\n548\t    arc_c_uniform: 0.4812\n549\t    arc_c_mckp: 0.5137\n550\t    arc_c_delta_pp: 3.16\n551\t    hellaswag_uniform: 0.7284\n552\t    hellaswag_mckp: 0.7684\n553\t    hellaswag_delta_pp: 4.0\n554\t    piqa_uniform: 0.7661\n555\t    piqa_mckp: 0.7786\n556\t    piqa_delta_pp: 1.25\n557\t    winogrande_uniform: 0.6622\n558\t    winogrande_mckp: 0.6819\n559\t    winogrande_delta_pp: 1.97\n560\t    avg_recovery: 0.728\n561\t    bf16_avg: 0.688\n562\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen downstream gains 一致 positive（+1.25 to +4.00pp），与 PPL improvement  方向一致。但\n563\t    median reviewer 的核心 objection 是 A4：\"this only works on Qwen.\" 跨架构 downstream 数据显示\n564\t    Yi -0.77pp, Llama -0.99pp, Mistral -0.48pp,  Gemma-2 +0.14pp（noise）。reviewer 会写：\"4/5\n565\t    architectures show negative or  negligible downstream effect. The method degrades\n566\t    downstream performance on most  models.\" 另一个 median-specific concern 是 lack of\n567\t    multi-seed CI：3.16pp arc_c  delta 没有 confidence interval，\"could be within single-run\n568\t    variance\"（A6）。 已有 qwen_3seed_downstream_ci（arc_c std=0.0035, hellaswag std=0.0022）\n569\t    可部分回应。arc_challenge 跨模型系统性退化（Yi -3.24pp, Llama -2.65pp,  Mistral -1.19pp）会被特别标注——reviewer\n570\t    要求主动讨论这个 pattern。\n571\t\n572\t    '\n573\t  tables:\n574\t  - caption: 'Table: Downstream Evaluation — Full Cross-Architecture'\n575\t    rows:\n576\t    - model: Qwen (Spread)\n577\t      avg_delta_pp: '+2.60'\n578\t      arc_c_delta: '+3.16'\n579\t      verdict: Benefit\n580\t    - model: Yi-1.5 (Spike)\n581\t      avg_delta_pp: '-0.77'\n582\t      arc_c_delta: '-3.24'\n583\t      verdict: Degradation\n584\t    - model: Llama (Spike)\n585\t      avg_delta_pp: '-0.99'\n586\t      arc_c_delta: '-2.65'\n587\t      verdict: Degradation\n588\t    - model: Mistral (Flat)\n589\t      avg_delta_pp: '-0.48'\n590\t      arc_c_delta: '-1.19'\n591\t      verdict: Degradation\n592\t    - model: Gemma-2 (Flat)\n593\t      avg_delta_pp: '+0.14'\n594\t      arc_c_delta: '-0.17'\n595\t      verdict: Noise\n596\t  figures_description:\n597\t  - Per-task per-model heatmap（MCKP delta vs uniform），突出 arc_challenge 系统性退化\n598\t  analysis: 'Median 档中这是 double-edged evidence。Qwen 的 downstream gains 被认可但 限定为 \"architecture-specific\"。跨架构\n599\t    degradation 要求论文措辞从 \"non-uniform improves downstream\" 改为 \"non-uniform allocation\n600\t    improves downstream  performance specifically on architectures with spread sensitivity\n601\t    patterns (1/5  tested); on other architectures, uniform 4-bit should be preferred.\"  arc_challenge\n602\t    系统性退化需要主动讨论段落。\n603\t\n604\t    '\n605\t- name: 70B Profiling-Only\n606\t  plan_id: plan_013\n607\t  description: '在 Qwen2.5-72B 上做 distortion profiling（不做 full eval），分析 sensitivity  patterns\n608\t    是否随模型大小 scale。\n609\t\n610\t    '\n611\t  expected_results:\n612\t    status: killed\n613\t    sensitivity_pattern_observed: null\n614\t    l0_dominance_scales: null\n615\t  result_rationale: '实验被 killed（可能 OOM 或 timeout）。Median reviewer 会注意到 \"only 7B-14B  scale\n616\t    models tested\" 并标注为 limitation：\"no evidence that findings generalize  to production-scale\n617\t    models (70B+).\" 但在 median 档中这是 minor gap 而非 major  objection——大多数 KV cache quantization\n618\t    papers 也只测 7B-14B。缺少 70B 数据 会降低 \"practical implications\" 的说服力但不会导致 reject。建议在\n619\t    limitations  中明确承认 \"our experiments are limited to 7B-14B scale; scaling behavior\n620\t    of  compounding effects to 70B+ models remains an open question.\"\n621\t\n622\t    '\n623\t  tables: []\n624\t  figures_description: []\n625\t  analysis: 'Missing data。Median reviewer 标注为 limitation，不作为 reject reason。\n626\t\n627\t    '\n628\t- name: L0-Only Heuristic Baseline\n629\t  plan_id: plan_015\n630\t  description: '最简单的 non-uniform 策略：L0 heads 8-bit，其余 uniform 4-bit。如果 L0-only 匹配\n631\t    MCKP，full optimization 不必要。\n632\t\n633\t    '\n634\t  expected_results:\n635\t    qwen_mckp_ppl: 10.91\n636\t    qwen_l0_random_mean: 11.69\n637\t    qwen_l0_random_std: 0.47\n638\t    qwen_l0_random_median: 11.52\n639\t    qwen_naive_positional_ppl: 12.23\n640\t    llama_mckp_ppl: 8.45\n641\t    llama_l0_random_mean: 10.48\n642\t    llama_naive_positional: 9.94\n643\t    mistral_mckp_ppl: 7.16\n644\t    mistral_l0_random_mean: 7.56\n645\t    mistral_naive_positional: 7.48\n646\t    mckp_consistently_beats_l0_random: true\n647\t  result_rationale: 'L0-only heuristic 的 PPL（Qwen median 11.52, mean 11.69）consistently\n648\t    worse  than MCKP（10.91），差距 -5.2%。这说明 profiling-based allocation 在 constraint  内仍有\n649\t    optimization value——不仅仅是 \"protect L0 and done.\" Median reviewer  反应正面但有 nuance：(a)\n650\t    \"MCKP beats L0-random by 5.2% — meaningful but not  dramatic. The naive positional\n651\t    heuristic (12.23) is much worse, so profiling does  matter.\" (b) \"seed variance\n652\t    in L0-random is large (std=0.47, range 11.33-12.52),  suggesting the specific\n653\t    choice of which non-L0 heads get 2-bit matters significantly.\"  (c) Llama 和 Mistral\n654\t    上 MCKP vs L0-random gap 更大（Llama: 8.45 vs 10.04 median,  -15.8%），说明 even on non-benefit\n655\t    architectures, random constraint-respecting  allocation is much worse than MCKP\n656\t    — the solver finds better allocations even when  the absolute PPL difference vs\n657\t    uniform is small. 这个 experiment 的原始设计被 kill 但后来用 corrected version (l0_heuristic_corrected)\n658\t    完成。\n659\t\n660\t    '\n661\t  tables:\n662\t  - caption: 'Table: MCKP vs Heuristic Baselines (budget=0.25)'\n663\t    rows:\n664\t    - model: Qwen\n665\t      mckp: 10.91\n666\t      l0_random_median: 11.52\n667\t      naive_positional: 12.23\n668\t      uniform: 15.45\n669\t    - model: Llama\n670\t      mckp: 8.45\n671\t      l0_random_median: 10.04\n672\t      naive_positional: 9.94\n673\t      uniform: 8.47\n674\t    - model: Mistral\n675\t      mckp: 7.16\n676\t      l0_random_median: 7.59\n677\t      naive_positional: 7.48\n678\t      uniform: 7.13\n679\t  figures_description:\n680\t  - 'Bar chart per architecture: MCKP < L0-random < naive positional（Qwen pattern）'\n681\t  analysis: 'Median reviewer 认为这是 critical missing baseline 被补充后的 adequate response。\n682\t    MCKP vs L0-random gap（5-16%）证明 solver 在 constraint-respecting 方案中仍有 optimization\n683\t    价值。但 Mistral 的 MCKP(7.16) > uniform(7.13) 再次说明 flat  architecture 上任何 non-uniform\n684\t    都是 net negative。\n685\t\n686\t    '\n687\t- name: Greedy + Cardinality Constraint Ablation (Solver Equivalence)\n688\t  plan_id: plan_016\n689\t  description: 'RateQuant greedy + max_2bit=k 约束。对比 (a) greedy unconstrained,  (b)\n690\t    greedy constrained k=8, (c) MCKP constrained k=8。\n691\t\n692\t    '\n693\t  expected_results:\n694\t    greedy_unconstrained_ppl: 32.45\n695\t    greedy_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n696\t    mckp_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n697\t    delta_greedy_vs_mckp_constrained: 0.0012\n698\t    bit_distribution_identical: true\n699\t    distribution: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n700\t  result_rationale: '这是 paper 最 powerful 的单个实验：constrained greedy = constrained MCKP  (Δ=0.0012\n701\t    PPL, identical bit distribution)。证明 constraint 是唯一 intervention  that matters——两个算法复杂度完全不同的\n702\t    solver 在 constraint 下产生相同解。 Median reviewer 对此实验的反应最 positive：\"this is the strongest\n703\t    evidence in the  paper — it shows the cardinality constraint is the real contribution,\n704\t    not the  optimization algorithm.\" 但也引发 A3 concern：\"if a simple cardinality constraint  is\n705\t    all you need, this is essentially one hyperparameter — is that a sufficient  contribution\n706\t    for a main conference paper?\" Reviewer 会要求 (a) 更强的 principled  justification for\n707\t    why cardinality constraint works（不只是 empirical observation）， (b) 讨论 constraint\n708\t    与 RateQuant 的 distortion model 的关系。Qwen14b 上也验证了 solver equivalence（greedy=MCKP,\n709\t    Δ=0.0），增加了 generality。\n710\t\n711\t    '\n712\t  tables:\n713\t  - caption: 'Table: Solver Equivalence Under Constraint (Qwen2.5-7B, k=8)'\n714\t    rows:\n715\t    - solver: Greedy unconstrained\n716\t      ppl: 32.45\n717\t      bit_dist: '{2:68, 4:30, 8:4, 16:10}'\n718\t      status: FAIL\n719\t    - solver: Greedy + max_2bit=8\n720\t      ppl: 11.23\n721\t      bit_dist: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n722\t      status: PASS\n723\t    - solver: MCKP + max_2bit=8\n724\t      ppl: 11.23\n725\t      bit_dist: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n726\t      status: PASS\n727\t    - solver: Uniform 4-bit\n728\t      ppl: 15.45\n729\t      bit_dist: all 4-bit\n730\t      status: baseline\n731\t  figures_description:\n732\t  - 'Side-by-side bit allocation heatmaps: greedy constrained vs MCKP constrained（完全一致）'\n733\t  analysis: 'Median 档中被认可为 paper 的 highlight。两位 reviewer 会引用此结果支持 \"the constraint\n734\t    is the contribution\" narrative。但第三位 reviewer 用此结果 反驳 \"then what exactly is the\n735\t    technical contribution — discovering that you need  a max_2bit cap? That''s a\n736\t    hyperparameter, not a method.\"\n737\t\n738\t    '\n739\t- name: Multi-Seed Error Bars\n740\t  plan_id: plan_017\n741\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B 上 3 个不同 calibration seed 的 constrained MCKP，报告 mean±std。\n742\t\n743\t    '\n744\t  expected_results:\n745\t    mckp_seed0: 11.02\n746\t    mckp_seed1: 10.9\n747\t    mckp_seed2: 11.05\n748\t    mckp_mean: 10.99\n749\t    mckp_std: 0.065\n750\t    bit_dist_all_seeds: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n751\t    allocation_agreement_3way: 0.902\n752\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n753\t    improvement_significant: true\n754\t    ci_95_upper: 11.12\n755\t    ci_95_lower: 10.86\n756\t  result_rationale: 'std=0.065 意味着 95% CI 约 [10.86, 11.12]，远低于 uniform 15.45——improvement  统计上\n757\t    robust。Bit distribution 在所有 seed 下一致（{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}）， allocation agreement\n758\t    90.2% 跨 seed。Median reviewer 会认可 PPL stability 但有 两个 residual concerns：(a) \"3\n759\t    seeds is the minimum — 5 seeds with proper CI would  be more convincing\"（minor\n760\t    revision level），(b) \"allocation agreement 90.2% means  10% of heads flip between\n761\t    seeds — which heads and how does it affect downstream?\"  更严重的是 A6：**缺少 multi-seed\n762\t    downstream CI**。PPL multi-seed 已有，但  downstream 的 arc_c +3.16pp 没有 error bar。qwen_3seed_downstream_ci\n763\t    提供了 部分数据（arc_c std=0.0035），但只在 Qwen 上。Reviewer 会标注 \"multi-seed  downstream CI\n764\t    missing for non-Qwen architectures\" 作为 significant gap。\n765\t\n766\t    '\n767\t  tables:\n768\t  - caption: 'Table: Multi-Seed PPL Stability (Qwen2.5-7B, k=8)'\n769\t    rows:\n770\t    - seed: 0\n771\t      ppl: 11.02\n772\t      bit_dist: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n773\t    - seed: 1\n774\t      ppl: 10.9\n775\t      bit_dist: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n776\t    - seed: 2\n777\t      ppl: 11.05\n778\t      bit_dist: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n779\t    - seed: mean±std\n780\t      ppl: 10.99±0.065\n781\t      bit_dist: consistent\n782\t  figures_description:\n783\t  - 'Error bar plot: MCKP mean±std vs uniform（non-overlapping）'\n784\t  analysis: 'Median reviewer 接受 PPL 层面的 statistical credibility 但要求 downstream CI。\n785\t    这是 median 档的 typical gap——不至于 reject 但会是 \"requested revision\" 的一部分。\n786\t\n787\t    '\n788\t- name: Runtime/Latency Benchmark\n789\t  plan_id: plan_018\n790\t  description: 'End-to-end inference latency 和 throughput，mixed-precision KV cache\n791\t    vs uniform 4-bit。\n792\t\n793\t    '\n794\t  expected_results:\n795\t    bf16_prefill_ms: 45.86\n796\t    bf16_decode_ms: 33.78\n797\t    bf16_throughput: 29.6\n798\t    uniform4_prefill_ms: 54.25\n799\t    uniform4_decode_ms: 42.46\n800\t    uniform4_throughput: 23.6\n801\t    mckp_prefill_ms: 57.03\n802\t    mckp_decode_ms: 46.09\n803\t    mckp_throughput: 21.8\n804\t    mckp_solver_time_sec: 0.005\n805\t    memory_compression_4x: true\n806\t    mckp_overhead_vs_uniform_pct: 8.5\n807\t    mckp_overhead_vs_bf16_pct: 36.4\n808\t  result_rationale: '令人意外的 negative finding：mixed-precision MCKP 比 uniform 4-bit 更慢\n809\t    （throughput 21.8 vs 23.6 tok/s, -7.6%），甚至比 bf16 baseline 更慢 （21.8 vs 29.6 tok/s,\n810\t    -26.4%）。原因是 mixed-precision 需要 per-head 不同 的 dequantization kernel，当前实现缺少 fused\n811\t    kernel optimization。 Median reviewer 反应强烈 negative：\"the method provides 29% PPL\n812\t    improvement  on Qwen but costs 8% throughput — practitioners would need to decide\n813\t    if PPL  improvement justifies speed regression. On 7/8 architectures where there''s\n814\t    no  PPL benefit, the speed cost is pure overhead.\" 这成为 major objection 之一（A6  范畴）。MCKP\n815\t    solver 本身只需 0.005s（negligible），所以 overhead 完全来自 inference-time mixed-precision\n816\t    dequantization。需要在 paper 中承认 \"current  implementation uses naive per-head dequantization;\n817\t    a fused kernel could eliminate  the overhead\" 并标注为 engineering limitation, not\n818\t    fundamental。但 reviewer 会 counter：\"without the optimized kernel, the practical\n819\t    benefit claim is weakened.\"\n820\t\n821\t    '\n822\t  tables:\n823\t  - caption: 'Table: Runtime Benchmark (Qwen2.5-7B, seq_len=2048)'\n824\t    rows:\n825\t    - method: BF16 (no quantization)\n826\t      prefill_ms: 45.86\n827\t      decode_ms: 33.78\n828\t      throughput: 29.6\n829\t      memory_MB: 21\n830\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n831\t      prefill_ms: 54.25\n832\t      decode_ms: 42.46\n833\t      throughput: 23.6\n834\t      memory_MB: 5.25\n835\t    - method: Constrained MCKP\n836\t      prefill_ms: 57.03\n837\t      decode_ms: 46.09\n838\t      throughput: 21.8\n839\t      memory_MB: 5.25\n840\t  figures_description:\n841\t  - Throughput vs memory tradeoff scatter plot：三种 method 的 Pareto 位置\n842\t  analysis: 'Median 档中这是 second major objection source。Runtime overhead 与  \"practical\n843\t    implications\" claim 冲突。Paper 需要 reframe：\"memory-bound  scenarios (long context,\n844\t    large batch) where 4× memory reduction enables  deployment that bf16 cannot.\"\n845\t    8K context 实验（qwen7b_8k_context_eval:  uniform 77.75 vs MCKP 8.59）是 strongest\n846\t    counterargument——at long context,  memory savings dominate and quality gap amplifies\n847\t    dramatically。'\n848\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f6b0b3c4-17a1-4fb2-92fd-0f4f71a4e809","uuid":"dcc72bb9-58c2-4b26-94e6-3ba8f28e0fa4","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:52:49.794Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/ratekv/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T021448/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Compounding 发现被承认为有价值的实证贡献，但 RateQuant Appendix M 已 acknowledge\n  该现象导致 novelty 打折。 Reviewer 要求去掉 ''universal'' 改为 ''consistent pattern across 8 architectures''，constraint\n  被部分 reviewer  视为 ''obvious hyperparameter tuning'' 而非 principled contribution，需要更强的理论\n  justification。 1/8 downstream benefit 被至少 1 位 reviewer 视为 ''this only works on Qwen''。Diagnostic\n  n=9 只能作为  observation，不能作为独立 claim。论文需要 reframe 为 empirical analysis paper，前置 analysis\n  contribution。 预估 narrative rewrite 30-40%，主要集中在 intro、claim 措辞、和 related work 对\n  RateQuant 的讨论。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: L0 Exclusion Removal Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '移除 L0 排除约束，仅保留 max_2bit=8，验证 solver 纯粹从 profiling data 自动发现 L0 敏感结构。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    solver_auto_assigns_8bit_to_L0: true\n    ppl_without_l0_exclusion: 10.91\n    ppl_with_l0_exclusion: 10.91\n    delta: 0.0\n    l0_heads_assigned_8bit: 4\n    bit_distribution: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下该结果被 reviewer 认可为 neat ablation——solver 自动发现 L0 是最敏感的层，\n    不需要手动排除。但 reviewer 会指出这只在 Qwen 上验证（L0 dominance ratio=26×）， 对于 L0 dominance 低的架构（Yi\n    0.07，Mistral 1.74）solver 是否同样能自动发现正确结构 缺少验证。一位 reviewer 可能注释 \"this is expected\n    — L0 has the largest profiling delta  by far, so any reasonable solver would protect\n    it.\" 不会成为主要 objection，但也不会 被视为独立贡献。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: L0 Exclusion Ablation (Qwen2.5-7B, budget=0.25)'\n    rows:\n    - condition: MCKP + L0 exclusion + max_2bit=8\n      ppl: 10.91\n      l0_bit: 8-bit (hard-coded)\n      note: 原始设置\n    - condition: MCKP + max_2bit=8 only\n      ppl: 10.91\n      l0_bit: 8-bit (solver-discovered)\n      note: solver 自动分配\n  figures_description:\n  - Bit allocation heatmap 对比：有/无 L0 exclusion，两者完全一致\n  analysis: 'Reviewer 评价：supportive but minor。在 median 档中被视为 completeness ablation  而非核心证据。reviewer\n    可能建议移到 appendix。不影响主要 claim 但增加 paper 完整性。\n\n    '\n- name: Llama-3.1-8B Full Pipeline Replication\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '在 Llama-3.1-8B（GQA 4:1）上复制完整 pipeline——profiling、constrained MCKP、PPL\n    评估。 测试跨架构泛化性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_ppl_bf16: 8.09\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 8.47\n    mckp_constrained_ppl: 8.45\n    delta_vs_uniform_pct: 0.2\n    delta_vs_uniform_ppl: 0.02\n    memory_ratio: 0.25\n    bit_distribution: '{2:2, 4:253, 8:1}'\n    natural_2bit_count: 2\n    constraint_binds: false\n    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.07\n    top5_concentration: 0.57\n    distribution_shape: Spike\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下，Llama 的 marginal 结果（+0.2% vs uniform）成为 reviewer 攻击点之一。\n    reviewer 会写 \"the method provides essentially no benefit on Llama — the +0.2%  improvement\n    is within noise.\" Llama 的 spike distribution（L2H5 单个 outlier 主导， t₁/t₅≈0.85）导致\n    solver 只选择 2 个 head 做 2-bit，constraint 从不触发（natural k=2 < max_2bit=8）， MCKP 优化空间极小。这解释了为什么\n    PPL 差异几乎为零。但从 compounding 角度， unconstrained 仍然 1.07× baseline，说明即使 mild 情况下 solver\n    仍会略微 over-allocate。 Reviewer 会要求诚实报告 \"no benefit\" 而非 spin 为 positive。在 median\n    档中， 这个 negative result 本身不被反对——reviewer 反对的是用 8 个架构中只有 1 个 positive  来声称 method\n    有效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Llama-3.1-8B Pipeline Results (budget=0.25)'\n    rows:\n    - method: BF16 baseline\n      ppl: 8.09\n      bits: '16'\n      note: ''\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 8.47\n      bits: '4.0'\n      note: ''\n    - method: Unconstrained MCKP\n      ppl: 8.63\n      bits: mixed\n      note: 1.07× baseline\n    - method: Constrained MCKP (k=8)\n      ppl: 8.45\n      bits: '{2:2, 4:253, 8:1}'\n      note: +0.2% vs uniform\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-head sensitivity heatmap：极少数 head 有显著 delta，大部分 flat\n  analysis: 'Median reviewer 会同时肯定和批评：肯定 honest reporting of negative result， 批评 \"if\n    7/8 architectures show no benefit, this is not a method paper — it''s an  analysis\n    paper that happens to find one architecture where optimization helps.\"  这强化了 reframe\n    为 empirical analysis 的需要。\n\n    '\n- name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 Full Pipeline Replication\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '在 Mistral-7B-v0.3 上复制完整 pipeline。不同架构家族，建立跨架构有效性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_ppl_bf16: 7.035\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 7.131\n    mckp_constrained_ppl: 7.165\n    delta_vs_uniform_pct: -0.5\n    delta_vs_uniform_ppl: -0.034\n    memory_ratio: 0.25\n    bit_distribution: '{2:4, 4:252}'\n    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.08\n    top5_concentration: 0.22\n    distribution_shape: Flat\n    k_ablation_monotonic: true\n    best_k_still_worse_than_uniform: true\n  result_rationale: 'Mistral 是最强 negative case：MCKP 在所有 k 值下都 worse than uniform。\n    PPL 随 k 单调递增（k=4: 7.165, k=8: 7.200, k=18: 7.323），profiler 报告近零  sensitivity 差异（concentration=0.22,\n    CV=1.31）。这表明 Mistral 的 KV head  sensitivity 高度均匀——没有 head 从 2-bit downgrade 中获益。Median\n    reviewer  会将此视为 \"method failure on flat architectures\" 和 \"proof that uniform 4-bit  is\n    optimal when profiler gives zero signal.\" 对 compounding claim 仍有帮助： unconstrained\n    1.08× 表明即使 flat distribution，solver 仍 over-allocate  2-bit heads（42/256=16.4%）。但\n    reviewer 会质疑 \"1.08× is hardly catastrophic  — this is within the range where a\n    practitioner wouldn''t even notice.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Mistral-7B-v0.3 k-Ablation (budget=0.25)'\n    rows:\n    - k: 4\n      ppl: 7.165\n      n_2bit: 4\n      note: best constrained, still > uniform\n    - k: 8\n      ppl: 7.2\n      n_2bit: 8\n      note: ''\n    - k: 16\n      ppl: 7.311\n      n_2bit: 16\n      note: ''\n    - k: uniform\n      ppl: 7.131\n      n_2bit: 0\n      note: optimal for Mistral\n  figures_description:\n  - k-PPL 单调递增曲线，与 Qwen 的 U-shaped 对比\n  analysis: '在 median 档中，Mistral negative result 既是弱点也是优势。弱点：method 不 work。 优势：honest\n    negative result 增加 credibility，且支持 diagnostic 的必要性—— 如果没有 diagnostic，practitioners\n    会浪费 profiling 时间在 Mistral 这样的模型上。 Reviewer 2 (偏方法) 会将此作为 \"method only works on\n    Qwen\" 的证据。 Reviewer 3 (偏分析) 会认可这增加了 paper 的科学价值。\n\n    '\n- name: Compounding Effect Characterization Sweep\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B 上扫 max_2bit 从 0 到 112，绘制 PPL vs max_2bit 曲线， 确定 compounding\n    阈值。建立 cardinality constraint 的 principled 基础。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    k0_ppl: 9.81\n    k8_ppl: 10.05\n    k16_ppl: 10.42\n    k32_ppl: 11.6\n    k64_ppl: 23.22\n    k112_ppl: 98.75\n    compounding_threshold_k: 16\n    max_compounding_ratio: 10.07\n    curve_shape: superlinear after k≈16, exponential after k≈48\n    safe_k_range: k≤8 universally <2.5% degradation\n  result_rationale: 'Compounding sweep 是 median 档中最被认可的实验——提供了 compounding 效应的 定量证据。PPL\n    在 k≤8 时近线性增长（9.81→10.05, +2.4%），k=16-32 开始加速 （10.42→11.60），k≥48 后指数爆炸（23.22→98.75）。这条曲线是\n    \"principled  basis for constraint selection\" 的核心证据。但 median reviewer 会有两个质疑： (1)\n    \"这条曲线只在 Qwen 上做了——其他架构的阈值可能完全不同\"（A2）， (2) \"RateQuant Appendix M 已经 acknowledge\n    compounding，这个 sweep 只是 quantified 了已知现象\"（A1）。需要补充 Llama 和 Mistral 的 compounding\n    sweep  来部分 address (1)——实际已有数据（llama_compounding_sweep, mistral_compounding_sweep_v2）\n    可以回应。Reviewer 对 k≤8 safety 的 claim 会接受，但会要求去掉 \"universally safe\"  改为 \"safe across\n    all tested architectures.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Compounding Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B, budget=0.25)'\n    rows:\n    - k: 0\n      ppl: 9.81\n      ratio_to_baseline: 1.00×\n    - k: 8\n      ppl: 10.05\n      ratio_to_baseline: 1.02×\n    - k: 16\n      ppl: 10.42\n      ratio_to_baseline: 1.06×\n    - k: 32\n      ppl: 11.6\n      ratio_to_baseline: 1.18×\n    - k: 64\n      ppl: 23.22\n      ratio_to_baseline: 2.37×\n    - k: 112\n      ppl: 98.75\n      ratio_to_baseline: 10.07×\n  figures_description:\n  - PPL vs max_2bit 曲线（log-scale y-axis），标注 safe zone（k≤8）和 catastrophic zone（k≥48）\n  - 三架构对比 compounding sweep（Qwen U-shaped, Llama flat, Mistral monotonic）\n  analysis: 'Median reviewer 的核心反馈：compounding effect 是 real and well-characterized，\n    但 novelty 因 RateQuant Appendix M 打折。建议在 related work 中显式讨论  \"RateQuant acknowledges\n    compounding in Appendix M but does not characterize the  threshold or provide\n    a fix — our sweep provides the first quantitative mapping.\"  三架构对比增加说服力：Qwen 的\n    U-shape（optimal k=8）、Llama 的 flat profile （natural k=2, constraint irrelevant）、Mistral\n    的 monotonic increase（every  2-bit head hurts）展示了 architecture-dependent compounding\n    behavior。\n\n    '\n- name: Budget Sweep (2×/4×/8× Compression)\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 2×/4×/8× 压缩比下的 constrained MCKP vs uniform baseline。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    budget_0.5_mckp_ppl: 9.85\n    budget_0.5_uniform_ppl: 9.86\n    budget_0.5_delta_pct: 0.1\n    budget_0.25_mckp_ppl: 10.91\n    budget_0.25_uniform_ppl: 15.45\n    budget_0.25_delta_pct: 29.4\n    budget_0.125_mckp_ppl: 57.6\n    budget_0.125_uniform_2bit_ppl: 2643.77\n    budget_0.125_delta_ratio: 45.9×\n    compression_amplifies_benefit: true\n  result_rationale: 'Budget sweep 展示了核心趋势：压缩越激进，constrained MCKP vs uniform 的差距越大。\n    在 2× 压缩下差异几乎为零（都接近 baseline），4× 时 MCKP 优势 29.4%，8× 时 MCKP 57.60 vs uniform 2643.77（45×差距）。Median\n    reviewer 会认可 aggressive  compression 的 practical value（\"at 8× compression, the\n    constraint is the difference  between usable and unusable\"），但会指出：(a) 2× 结果说明 moderate\n    compression 下 benefit 主要来自 Qwen 的 spread pattern 而非 method 本身，(b) 8× 的 PPL=57.60  虽远好于\n    2643.77，但 absolute 值仍然很高——\"is a 57.60 PPL model actually usable?\"  需要补充 aggressive\n    compression 下的 downstream task 评估。(c) 只在 Qwen 上做了 full sweep，Llama 的 aggressive\n    compression 数据（57.60 vs 2643.77）虽有但 仅一个点，不是 sweep。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Budget Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B)'\n    rows:\n    - compression: 2× (budget=0.5)\n      mckp_ppl: 9.85\n      uniform_ppl: 9.86\n      delta: ~0%\n    - compression: 4× (budget=0.25)\n      mckp_ppl: 10.91\n      uniform_ppl: 15.45\n      delta: 29.4%\n    - compression: 8× (budget=0.125)\n      mckp_ppl: 57.6\n      uniform_ppl: 2643.77\n      delta: 45.9×\n  figures_description:\n  - Compression ratio vs PPL 对比图：MCKP 和 uniform 两条线在高压缩比处剧烈分离\n  analysis: 'Median 档中被部分接受。Reviewer 认可 practical implication（高压缩比下 constraint  essential），但质疑\n    moderate compression（主要应用场景）下只有 Qwen 获益的泛化性。 建议补充 Llama/Mistral 的 budget sweep\n    至少在 8× 压缩点。\n\n    '\n- name: High-Resolution Profiling\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '64 seq × 2048 tokens 的高分辨率 profiling（vs 16×512），验证更好的 profiling  是否改善\n    solver allocation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    hires_constrained_ppl_bf16: 10.91\n    lowres_constrained_ppl_bf16: 11.23\n    baseline_ppl_bf16: 9.81\n    improvement_vs_lowres: 0.32\n    improvement_pct: 2.8\n    hires_nonzero_2bit_heads: 100\n    lowres_nonzero_2bit_heads: 37\n    allocation_diff_count: 8\n    profiling_time_min: 65.5\n    bit_distribution: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n  result_rationale: '高分辨率 profiling 将 PPL 从 11.23 降到 10.91（-2.8%），说明 profiling resolution  matters。核心改进来自更准确的\n    sensitivity ranking：hires 发现 100/112 heads 有 非零 2-bit delta（vs lowres 37/112），导致\n    8 个 head 的 allocation 改变。 Median reviewer 反应分化：(a) 方法 reviewer 认为这说明 \"profiling\n    quality drives  results more than solver choice — the real engineering is in the\n    profiler, not MCKP\"， 进一步削弱 solver 作为贡献的地位；(b) 系统 reviewer 注意到 65.5 min profiling\n    time  并质疑 \"practitioners won''t spend an hour profiling a 7B model to save 0.32\n    PPL\"。 需要在 paper 中 trade-off profiling cost vs quality，并论证 lowres 已足够好 （11.23 vs\n    uniform 15.45, 仍有 27.3% improvement）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Profiling Resolution Impact (Qwen2.5-7B, k=8)'\n    rows:\n    - resolution: Low-res (16×512)\n      ppl: 11.23\n      nonzero_heads: 37\n      time_min: ~10\n    - resolution: High-res (64×2048)\n      ppl: 10.91\n      nonzero_heads: 100\n      time_min: 65.5\n    - resolution: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 15.45\n      nonzero_heads: N/A\n      time_min: 0\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-head delta comparison：lowres vs hires scatter plot，标注 allocation 改变的 8 个 head\n  analysis: 'Median 档中作为 engineering insight 被接受。Reviewer 不会 object 但建议 放 appendix\n    而非 main body。对 claim 的影响中性——既不强化也不削弱核心论点。\n\n    '\n- name: C4 Cross-Dataset Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '在 C4 上评估 Qwen2.5-7B（calibrate on WikiText-2, eval on C4; calibrate\n    on C4, eval on WikiText-2）， 验证结果不是 WikiText-2 specific。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    c4_cal_wt2_eval_mckp_ppl: 11.29\n    c4_cal_wt2_eval_uniform_ppl: 15.45\n    c4_cal_wt2_eval_delta: 4.15\n    allocation_agreement_c4_vs_wt2: 0.964\n    agreement_heads: 108/112\n    cross_domain_wt2_to_c4_mckp_ppl: 20.56\n    cross_domain_wt2_to_c4_uniform_ppl: 35.42\n    contamination_impact: 0.034\n  result_rationale: '96.4% allocation agreement 跨 calibration source 是 positive signal：profiling  的\n    head sensitivity ranking 对 calibration data 不敏感。Median reviewer 会认可  cross-dataset\n    robustness 但指出：(a) 只在 Qwen 上验证（\"is this agreement rate  architecture-dependent?\"），(b)\n    4/112 disagreement heads 的 identity 和影响未讨论， (c) cross-domain PPL（WiKi→C4: 20.56\n    vs uniform 35.42）虽然 MCKP 仍胜出， 但绝对 PPL 远高于 same-domain（11.29），说明 calibration domain\n    mismatch 仍有成本。 Reviewer 会建议 \"report agreement rate on at least one more architecture\"\n    作为 minor revision。已有 llama_c4_cross_dataset（97.7% agreement）和  mistral_c4_cross_dataset（96.5%）数据可以回应。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Cross-Dataset Calibration Agreement'\n    rows:\n    - model: Qwen2.5-7B\n      agreement: 108/112 (96.4%)\n      same_domain_ppl: 11.29\n      cross_domain_ppl: 20.56\n    - model: Llama-3.1-8B\n      agreement: 250/256 (97.7%)\n      same_domain_ppl: 8.45\n      cross_domain_ppl: 8.65\n    - model: Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      agreement: 247/256 (96.5%)\n      same_domain_ppl: 7.16\n      cross_domain_ppl: 7.19\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '三架构的 >96% agreement 是 strong evidence for calibration robustness。 Median\n    reviewer 视为 useful supplementary experiment，不会 object。 建议放 Section 4 或 appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: RateQuant Greedy Comparison\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '实现 RateQuant 的 greedy Algorithm 1 在 {2,4,8,16} 上，展示 greedy 在 non-consecutive\n    集合上 suboptimal。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ratequant_greedy_unconstrained_ppl: 32.45\n    mckp_unconstrained_ppl: 36.92\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n    greedy_bit_distribution: '{2:68, 4:30, 8:4, 16:10}'\n    both_worse_than_uniform: true\n    greedy_better_than_mckp_unconstrained: true\n  result_rationale: '关键发现：两个 solver 在 unconstrained 设置下都 worse than uniform，但 greedy  (32.45)\n    反而比 MCKP (36.92) 好！这颠覆了 \"MCKP is better optimizer\" 的叙事。 Median reviewer 会抓住这个点：\"if\n    greedy outperforms MCKP unconstrained,  why do you need MCKP at all?\" 回应：unconstrained\n    时两者都失败（compounding）， 差异无意义；constrained 时两者完全一致（Δ=0.0000）——plan_016 的 solver equivalence  证据。但这确实削弱了\n    MCKP 作为 solver contribution 的叙事，支持 reframe： \"constraint is the contribution, not\n    the solver.\" 一位 reviewer 会标注  \"the unconstrained MCKP being worse than greedy\n    suggests the ILP formulation  interacts poorly with compounding — discuss this.\"\n    需要在 paper 中解释为什么 MCKP 更容易 over-allocate 2-bit（因为它更 aggressively optimizes per-head  cost-benefit，导致更多\n    2-bit assignments）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Unconstrained Solver Comparison (Qwen2.5-7B)'\n    rows:\n    - solver: RateQuant Greedy (unconstrained)\n      ppl: 32.45\n      n_2bit: 68\n      status: FAIL\n    - solver: MCKP (unconstrained)\n      ppl: 36.92\n      n_2bit: ≥68\n      status: FAIL\n    - solver: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 15.45\n      n_2bit: 0\n      status: baseline\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: 三种 method PPL 对比，unconstrained 均远超 uniform'\n  analysis: 'Median 档中该实验的价值被 reinterpret：不再是 \"MCKP beats greedy\"  而是 \"both fail without\n    constraint, both succeed with constraint.\"  这是 solver equivalence 叙事的第一半证据。Reviewer\n    认可这个 framing shift。\n\n    '\n- name: Oracle Comparison (Subset Brute-Force)\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B 的 3-4 个 layer group 上做 brute-force optimal allocation，\n    量化 MCKP gap to oracle。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mckp_ppl: 10.91\n    max_oracle_gap_ppl: 0.018\n    avg_oracle_gap_ppl: 0.005\n    layers_mckp_optimal: 5/8\n    layers_with_gap: 3\n    gap_nature: 2-bit head position swap within same bit budget\n    total_evals: 54\n  result_rationale: 'MCKP 与 oracle 的 gap 极小（max 0.018 PPL, avg 0.005 PPL），5/8 layer\n    groups  完全 optimal，3 个 gap 来自同 budget 下 2-bit head 位置互换。Median reviewer  会认可 \"MCKP\n    is near-optimal within the constrained feasible set\" 但立刻指出： \"combined with plan_016\n    showing greedy=MCKP, this means the constraint defines  the quality — any solver\n    that respects the constraint is near-optimal. The MCKP  formulation adds no value.\"\n    这进一步支持 constraint-as-contribution framing， 但同时使 MCKP 作为 method 贡献更不站得住。reviewer\n    建议 \"present MCKP as the  analysis framework, not the algorithmic contribution.\"\n    在 median 档中这个实验 反而帮助了 reframe——它是 \"solver doesn''t matter\" 叙事的 complementary evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: MCKP vs Oracle Gap (Qwen2.5-7B, per layer group)'\n    rows:\n    - layer_group: L0-L3\n      mckp_optimal: true\n      gap_ppl: 0.0\n    - layer_group: L4-L7\n      mckp_optimal: false\n      gap_ppl: 0.0045\n    - layer_group: L8-L11\n      mckp_optimal: false\n      gap_ppl: 0.0136\n    - layer_group: L12-L15\n      mckp_optimal: true\n      gap_ppl: 0.0\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Near-zero oracle gap 与 solver equivalence 共同构成 \"constraint is what matters\"  的完整论证。Median\n    reviewer 视为 thorough analysis, 建议作为 Section 4 的 supporting evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Domain Calibration Robustness\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 'C4 calibration → WikiText-2 eval 和反方向，报告 per-head allocation agreement\n    rate。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    allocation_agreement_c4_vs_wt2: 0.964\n    agreement_heads: 108/112\n    c4_cal_wt2_eval_mckp_ppl: 11.29\n    cross_domain_gap_vs_same_domain: 0.06\n  result_rationale: '与 plan_007 共享数据。96.4% agreement 说明 profiling-based sensitivity\n    ranking  对 calibration source 高度鲁棒。Median reviewer 反应温和 positive——这是 expected\n    behavior（\"if head sensitivity is an architectural property, it shouldn''t  depend\n    on calibration data\"），所以不会 strongly impress but also won''t object。 主要 reviewer\n    concern 是 Qwen-only，但已有三架构数据（Qwen 96.4%, Llama 97.7%,  Mistral 96.5%）可补充。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Minor positive signal。在 median 档中作为 robustness check 被接受， 不影响 overall\n    score。\n\n    '\n- name: Head Sensitivity Visualization\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '生成 per-head profiling delta heatmap、compounding curve、budget allocation\n    对比图。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    figures_generated: 3\n    heatmap_shows_l0_dominance: true\n    compounding_curve_elbow: k≈16\n    allocation_comparison_shows_constraint_effect: true\n  result_rationale: '可视化是 presentation quality 问题而非科学证据。Median reviewer 会在 minor comments\n    中评价：\"Figure X clearly shows the L0 dominance pattern\"  或 \"the compounding curve\n    would benefit from error bars.\" 不影响 score 但 好的可视化可以帮助 reviewer 快速理解 compounding\n    现象。关键是 heatmap 要 展示 Qwen（spread, L0 cluster 明显）vs Yi（spike, 单个 L4H3 突出）vs  Gemma-2（flat,\n    无显著差异）的对比——如果只展示 Qwen，reviewer 会说  \"cherry-picked visualization.\"\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-head 2-bit delta heatmap（layers × heads），色彩标注 Qwen L0 cluster\n  - Compounding sweep 曲线（PPL vs k），标注 safe/moderate/catastrophic zones\n  - 'Budget allocation 对比（stacked bar: 2/4/8/16 bit distribution across methods）'\n  analysis: 'Presentation-level contribution。Median reviewer 可能 suggest 改进但不会 因为 visualization\n    加分或扣分。\n\n    '\n- name: K/V Separation\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: 'K 和 V heads 作为独立 MCKP items，独立 budget allocation。与 joint K=V 方法对比。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    kv_sep_ppl: 11.22\n    joint_kv_ppl: 10.91\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n    delta_sep_vs_joint: 0.31\n    sep_k_2bit_count: 16\n    sep_v_uniform_4bit: true\n    kv_asymmetric_heads: 21\n  result_rationale: 'K/V separation 反而 worse（11.22 vs 10.91, +0.31 PPL）。separation\n    给 K heads  分配了 16 个 2-bit（超过 max_2bit=8 的 joint 约束），导致 K cache compounding。 V\n    heads 在 separation 下全部 4-bit（optimal for V），但 K cache 的退化超过了 V 的收益。Median reviewer\n    会认为这是 negative result 但有 insight value： \"K cache is more sensitive to 2-bit compounding\n    than V — this explains why  joint K=V treatment with a single cardinality constraint\n    works better.\"  一位 reviewer 可能 suggest \"apply per-cache-type cardinality constraint\"  as\n    future work。不会成为 major objection。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: K/V Separation vs Joint (Qwen2.5-7B, k=8)'\n    rows:\n    - method: Joint K=V (k=8)\n      ppl: 10.91\n      k_2bit: 8\n      v_2bit: 0\n    - method: K/V Separation\n      ppl: 11.22\n      k_2bit: 16\n      v_2bit: 0\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 15.45\n      k_2bit: 0\n      v_2bit: 0\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Negative result 但 informative。在 median 档中被视为 thorough ablation， 可放 appendix。不影响核心\n    claim。\n\n    '\n- name: Downstream Task Evaluation (Qwen2.5-7B)\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 'ARC-C / HellaSwag / PIQA / WinoGrande 在 Qwen2.5-7B 4× 压缩下评估。 验证 PPL\n    improvement 转化为 downstream performance。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    arc_c_uniform: 0.4812\n    arc_c_mckp: 0.5137\n    arc_c_delta_pp: 3.16\n    hellaswag_uniform: 0.7284\n    hellaswag_mckp: 0.7684\n    hellaswag_delta_pp: 4.0\n    piqa_uniform: 0.7661\n    piqa_mckp: 0.7786\n    piqa_delta_pp: 1.25\n    winogrande_uniform: 0.6622\n    winogrande_mckp: 0.6819\n    winogrande_delta_pp: 1.97\n    avg_recovery: 0.728\n    bf16_avg: 0.688\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen downstream gains 一致 positive（+1.25 to +4.00pp），与 PPL improvement  方向一致。但\n    median reviewer 的核心 objection 是 A4：\"this only works on Qwen.\" 跨架构 downstream 数据显示\n    Yi -0.77pp, Llama -0.99pp, Mistral -0.48pp,  Gemma-2 +0.14pp（noise）。reviewer 会写：\"4/5\n    architectures show negative or  negligible downstream effect. The method degrades\n    downstream performance on most  models.\" 另一个 median-specific concern 是 lack of\n    multi-seed CI：3.16pp arc_c  delta 没有 confidence interval，\"could be within single-run\n    variance\"（A6）。 已有 qwen_3seed_downstream_ci（arc_c std=0.0035, hellaswag std=0.0022）\n    可部分回应。arc_challenge 跨模型系统性退化（Yi -3.24pp, Llama -2.65pp,  Mistral -1.19pp）会被特别标注——reviewer\n    要求主动讨论这个 pattern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Downstream Evaluation — Full Cross-Architecture'\n    rows:\n    - model: Qwen (Spread)\n      avg_delta_pp: '+2.60'\n      arc_c_delta: '+3.16'\n      verdict: Benefit\n    - model: Yi-1.5 (Spike)\n      avg_delta_pp: '-0.77'\n      arc_c_delta: '-3.24'\n      verdict: Degradation\n    - model: Llama (Spike)\n      avg_delta_pp: '-0.99'\n      arc_c_delta: '-2.65'\n      verdict: Degradation\n    - model: Mistral (Flat)\n      avg_delta_pp: '-0.48'\n      arc_c_delta: '-1.19'\n      verdict: Degradation\n    - model: Gemma-2 (Flat)\n      avg_delta_pp: '+0.14'\n      arc_c_delta: '-0.17'\n      verdict: Noise\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-task per-model heatmap（MCKP delta vs uniform），突出 arc_challenge 系统性退化\n  analysis: 'Median 档中这是 double-edged evidence。Qwen 的 downstream gains 被认可但 限定为 \"architecture-specific\"。跨架构\n    degradation 要求论文措辞从 \"non-uniform improves downstream\" 改为 \"non-uniform allocation\n    improves downstream  performance specifically on architectures with spread sensitivity\n    patterns (1/5  tested); on other architectures, uniform 4-bit should be preferred.\"  arc_challenge\n    系统性退化需要主动讨论段落。\n\n    '\n- name: 70B Profiling-Only\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: '在 Qwen2.5-72B 上做 distortion profiling（不做 full eval），分析 sensitivity  patterns\n    是否随模型大小 scale。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: killed\n    sensitivity_pattern_observed: null\n    l0_dominance_scales: null\n  result_rationale: '实验被 killed（可能 OOM 或 timeout）。Median reviewer 会注意到 \"only 7B-14B  scale\n    models tested\" 并标注为 limitation：\"no evidence that findings generalize  to production-scale\n    models (70B+).\" 但在 median 档中这是 minor gap 而非 major  objection——大多数 KV cache quantization\n    papers 也只测 7B-14B。缺少 70B 数据 会降低 \"practical implications\" 的说服力但不会导致 reject。建议在\n    limitations  中明确承认 \"our experiments are limited to 7B-14B scale; scaling behavior\n    of  compounding effects to 70B+ models remains an open question.\"\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Missing data。Median reviewer 标注为 limitation，不作为 reject reason。\n\n    '\n- name: L0-Only Heuristic Baseline\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: '最简单的 non-uniform 策略：L0 heads 8-bit，其余 uniform 4-bit。如果 L0-only 匹配\n    MCKP，full optimization 不必要。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_mckp_ppl: 10.91\n    qwen_l0_random_mean: 11.69\n    qwen_l0_random_std: 0.47\n    qwen_l0_random_median: 11.52\n    qwen_naive_positional_ppl: 12.23\n    llama_mckp_ppl: 8.45\n    llama_l0_random_mean: 10.48\n    llama_naive_positional: 9.94\n    mistral_mckp_ppl: 7.16\n    mistral_l0_random_mean: 7.56\n    mistral_naive_positional: 7.48\n    mckp_consistently_beats_l0_random: true\n  result_rationale: 'L0-only heuristic 的 PPL（Qwen median 11.52, mean 11.69）consistently\n    worse  than MCKP（10.91），差距 -5.2%。这说明 profiling-based allocation 在 constraint  内仍有\n    optimization value——不仅仅是 \"protect L0 and done.\" Median reviewer  反应正面但有 nuance：(a)\n    \"MCKP beats L0-random by 5.2% — meaningful but not  dramatic. The naive positional\n    heuristic (12.23) is much worse, so profiling does  matter.\" (b) \"seed variance\n    in L0-random is large (std=0.47, range 11.33-12.52),  suggesting the specific\n    choice of which non-L0 heads get 2-bit matters significantly.\"  (c) Llama 和 Mistral\n    上 MCKP vs L0-random gap 更大（Llama: 8.45 vs 10.04 median,  -15.8%），说明 even on non-benefit\n    architectures, random constraint-respecting  allocation is much worse than MCKP\n    — the solver finds better allocations even when  the absolute PPL difference vs\n    uniform is small. 这个 experiment 的原始设计被 kill 但后来用 corrected version (l0_heuristic_corrected)\n    完成。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: MCKP vs Heuristic Baselines (budget=0.25)'\n    rows:\n    - model: Qwen\n      mckp: 10.91\n      l0_random_median: 11.52\n      naive_positional: 12.23\n      uniform: 15.45\n    - model: Llama\n      mckp: 8.45\n      l0_random_median: 10.04\n      naive_positional: 9.94\n      uniform: 8.47\n    - model: Mistral\n      mckp: 7.16\n      l0_random_median: 7.59\n      naive_positional: 7.48\n      uniform: 7.13\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart per architecture: MCKP < L0-random < naive positional（Qwen pattern）'\n  analysis: 'Median reviewer 认为这是 critical missing baseline 被补充后的 adequate response。\n    MCKP vs L0-random gap（5-16%）证明 solver 在 constraint-respecting 方案中仍有 optimization\n    价值。但 Mistral 的 MCKP(7.16) > uniform(7.13) 再次说明 flat  architecture 上任何 non-uniform\n    都是 net negative。\n\n    '\n- name: Greedy + Cardinality Constraint Ablation (Solver Equivalence)\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: 'RateQuant greedy + max_2bit=k 约束。对比 (a) greedy unconstrained,  (b)\n    greedy constrained k=8, (c) MCKP constrained k=8。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    greedy_unconstrained_ppl: 32.45\n    greedy_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n    mckp_constrained_ppl: 11.23\n    delta_greedy_vs_mckp_constrained: 0.0012\n    bit_distribution_identical: true\n    distribution: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n  result_rationale: '这是 paper 最 powerful 的单个实验：constrained greedy = constrained MCKP  (Δ=0.0012\n    PPL, identical bit distribution)。证明 constraint 是唯一 intervention  that matters——两个算法复杂度完全不同的\n    solver 在 constraint 下产生相同解。 Median reviewer 对此实验的反应最 positive：\"this is the strongest\n    evidence in the  paper — it shows the cardinality constraint is the real contribution,\n    not the  optimization algorithm.\" 但也引发 A3 concern：\"if a simple cardinality constraint  is\n    all you need, this is essentially one hyperparameter — is that a sufficient  contribution\n    for a main conference paper?\" Reviewer 会要求 (a) 更强的 principled  justification for\n    why cardinality constraint works（不只是 empirical observation）， (b) 讨论 constraint\n    与 RateQuant 的 distortion model 的关系。Qwen14b 上也验证了 solver equivalence（greedy=MCKP,\n    Δ=0.0），增加了 generality。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Solver Equivalence Under Constraint (Qwen2.5-7B, k=8)'\n    rows:\n    - solver: Greedy unconstrained\n      ppl: 32.45\n      bit_dist: '{2:68, 4:30, 8:4, 16:10}'\n      status: FAIL\n    - solver: Greedy + max_2bit=8\n      ppl: 11.23\n      bit_dist: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n      status: PASS\n    - solver: MCKP + max_2bit=8\n      ppl: 11.23\n      bit_dist: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n      status: PASS\n    - solver: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 15.45\n      bit_dist: all 4-bit\n      status: baseline\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Side-by-side bit allocation heatmaps: greedy constrained vs MCKP constrained（完全一致）'\n  analysis: 'Median 档中被认可为 paper 的 highlight。两位 reviewer 会引用此结果支持 \"the constraint\n    is the contribution\" narrative。但第三位 reviewer 用此结果 反驳 \"then what exactly is the\n    technical contribution — discovering that you need  a max_2bit cap? That''s a\n    hyperparameter, not a method.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-Seed Error Bars\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B 上 3 个不同 calibration seed 的 constrained MCKP，报告 mean±std。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mckp_seed0: 11.02\n    mckp_seed1: 10.9\n    mckp_seed2: 11.05\n    mckp_mean: 10.99\n    mckp_std: 0.065\n    bit_dist_all_seeds: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n    allocation_agreement_3way: 0.902\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n    improvement_significant: true\n    ci_95_upper: 11.12\n    ci_95_lower: 10.86\n  result_rationale: 'std=0.065 意味着 95% CI 约 [10.86, 11.12]，远低于 uniform 15.45——improvement  统计上\n    robust。Bit distribution 在所有 seed 下一致（{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}）， allocation agreement\n    90.2% 跨 seed。Median reviewer 会认可 PPL stability 但有 两个 residual concerns：(a) \"3\n    seeds is the minimum — 5 seeds with proper CI would  be more convincing\"（minor\n    revision level），(b) \"allocation agreement 90.2% means  10% of heads flip between\n    seeds — which heads and how does it affect downstream?\"  更严重的是 A6：**缺少 multi-seed\n    downstream CI**。PPL multi-seed 已有，但  downstream 的 arc_c +3.16pp 没有 error bar。qwen_3seed_downstream_ci\n    提供了 部分数据（arc_c std=0.0035），但只在 Qwen 上。Reviewer 会标注 \"multi-seed  downstream CI\n    missing for non-Qwen architectures\" 作为 significant gap。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Multi-Seed PPL Stability (Qwen2.5-7B, k=8)'\n    rows:\n    - seed: 0\n      ppl: 11.02\n      bit_dist: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n    - seed: 1\n      ppl: 10.9\n      bit_dist: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n    - seed: 2\n      ppl: 11.05\n      bit_dist: '{2:8, 4:100, 8:4}'\n    - seed: mean±std\n      ppl: 10.99±0.065\n      bit_dist: consistent\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Error bar plot: MCKP mean±std vs uniform（non-overlapping）'\n  analysis: 'Median reviewer 接受 PPL 层面的 statistical credibility 但要求 downstream CI。\n    这是 median 档的 typical gap——不至于 reject 但会是 \"requested revision\" 的一部分。\n\n    '\n- name: Runtime/Latency Benchmark\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: 'End-to-end inference latency 和 throughput，mixed-precision KV cache\n    vs uniform 4-bit。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bf16_prefill_ms: 45.86\n    bf16_decode_ms: 33.78\n    bf16_throughput: 29.6\n    uniform4_prefill_ms: 54.25\n    uniform4_decode_ms: 42.46\n    uniform4_throughput: 23.6\n    mckp_prefill_ms: 57.03\n    mckp_decode_ms: 46.09\n    mckp_throughput: 21.8\n    mckp_solver_time_sec: 0.005\n    memory_compression_4x: true\n    mckp_overhead_vs_uniform_pct: 8.5\n    mckp_overhead_vs_bf16_pct: 36.4\n  result_rationale: '令人意外的 negative finding：mixed-precision MCKP 比 uniform 4-bit 更慢\n    （throughput 21.8 vs 23.6 tok/s, -7.6%），甚至比 bf16 baseline 更慢 （21.8 vs 29.6 tok/s,\n    -26.4%）。原因是 mixed-precision 需要 per-head 不同 的 dequantization kernel，当前实现缺少 fused\n    kernel optimization。 Median reviewer 反应强烈 negative：\"the method provides 29% PPL\n    improvement  on Qwen but costs 8% throughput — practitioners would need to decide\n    if PPL  improvement justifies speed regression. On 7/8 architectures where there''s\n    no  PPL benefit, the speed cost is pure overhead.\" 这成为 major objection 之一（A6  范畴）。MCKP\n    solver 本身只需 0.005s（negligible），所以 overhead 完全来自 inference-time mixed-precision\n    dequantization。需要在 paper 中承认 \"current  implementation uses naive per-head dequantization;\n    a fused kernel could eliminate  the overhead\" 并标注为 engineering limitation, not\n    fundamental。但 reviewer 会 counter：\"without the optimized kernel, the practical\n    benefit claim is weakened.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Runtime Benchmark (Qwen2.5-7B, seq_len=2048)'\n    rows:\n    - method: BF16 (no quantization)\n      prefill_ms: 45.86\n      decode_ms: 33.78\n      throughput: 29.6\n      memory_MB: 21\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      prefill_ms: 54.25\n      decode_ms: 42.46\n      throughput: 23.6\n      memory_MB: 5.25\n    - method: Constrained MCKP\n      prefill_ms: 57.03\n      decode_ms: 46.09\n      throughput: 21.8\n      memory_MB: 5.25\n  figures_description:\n  - Throughput vs memory tradeoff scatter plot：三种 method 的 Pareto 位置\n  analysis: 'Median 档中这是 second major objection source。Runtime overhead 与  \"practical\n    implications\" claim 冲突。Paper 需要 reframe：\"memory-bound  scenarios (long context,\n    large batch) where 4× memory reduction enables  deployment that bf16 cannot.\"\n    8K context 实验（qwen7b_8k_context_eval:  uniform 77.75 vs MCKP 8.59）是 strongest\n    counterargument——at long context,  memory savings dominate and quality gap amplifies\n    dramatically。'\n","numLines":848,"startLine":1,"totalLines":848}}}
