{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019w5UhghynTYHeKzrvU8QLA","type":"tool_result","content":"docs/paper/experiments.tex:134:On Qwen, constrained MCKP improves average 0-shot accuracy by 1.9 pts over uniform (mean over 3 seeds, $\\pm$1$\\sigma$ in Table~\\ref{tab:downstream}), with the largest gains on HellaSwag ($+$4.1) and PIQA ($+$2.0).\ndocs/paper/conclusion.tex:21:Downstream evaluation covers four 0-shot classification tasks (ARC-C, HellaSwag, PIQA, WinoGrande). For HellaSwag, we report raw accuracy (\\texttt{acc}) rather than length-normalized accuracy (\\texttt{acc\\_norm}). Generation tasks (summarization, translation, long-form QA) are not evaluated, and no confidence intervals are reported for the current single-seed results.\ndocs/paper/appendix.tex:122:\\paragraph{Multi-seed stability.}\ndocs/paper/main.aux:1279:\\@writefile{toc}{\\contentsline {paragraph}{Multi-seed stability.}{13}{section*.35}\\protected@file@percent }"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MG8RGMZBgpjvNJWxBwBHSt","session_id":"f6b0b3c4-17a1-4fb2-92fd-0f4f71a4e809","uuid":"87480b37-0c69-45a4-8151-16bbf2a8a8c1","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:54:16.181Z"}
